{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Horizons is a walking simulator that deals with the problem of seeking validation through others and how it grows old and exhausting as time goes on.\u00a0<br><br>You will land on an alien planet with the task of helping the native Jellyfish people. You use your electricity ball to remove the invasive shark species from the Jellyfish homes. Along the way you will learn more about what motivates you as a person and the internal struggles of Commander Storm.<br><br>Features<br>- A compelling narrative about what drives Captain Storm<br>- A cool alien planet with habitants to walk around and explore<br>- Electricity Powers to help the native people</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3490450?t=1743471084","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3490450?t=1743471084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490450/e2e41fecb54192c4f3c7915a1bc8508408aad78c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743471084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490450/e2e41fecb54192c4f3c7915a1bc8508408aad78c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743471084","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Horizons is a walking simulator that deals with the problem of seeking validation through others and how it grows old and exhausting as time goes on.\u00a0<br><br>You will land on an alien planet with the task of helping the native Jellyfish people. You use your electricity ball to remove the invasive shark species from the Jellyfish homes. Along the way you will learn more about what motivates you as a person and the internal struggles of Commander Storm.<br><br>Features<br>- A compelling narrative about what drives Captain Storm<br>- A cool alien planet with habitants to walk